              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Yesu amugambira ati, “Oleke abafu beziikire abafu babo. Iwe ogende orange obukama bwa Ruhanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.9.60",
